== Ninety-Nine Ōji of Nakahechi, Tanabe City == There are 13 Ōji shrines within this area, including {{ill|Takijiri Ōji|ja|滝尻王子|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Takijiri Ōji|qq=}}, {{ill|Daimon Ōji|ja|大門王子|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Daimon Ōji|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 九十九王子 (田辺市中辺路町)|1=Kujūkuōji (Nakahechichō, Tanabe)|comment=changed title based on wikidata|WD=Q11370053}}, {{ill|Chikatsuyu Ōji|ja|近露王子|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Chikatsuyu Ōji|qq=}}, and others, designated as part of the {{ill|Kumano Pilgrimage Route|ja|熊野参詣道|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kumano Pilgrimage Route|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 熊野古道|1=Kumano Kodō|comment=changed title based on wikidata|WD=Q17050475}}, a National Historic Site.<ref>{{Cite web|ja|url=https://www.city.tanabe.lg.jp/bunshin/bunkazai/shiteibunkazai_kinenbutsu.html|title=Designated Cultural Properties of Tanabe City - Monuments|publisher=Tanabe City Board of Education|accessdate=2009-03-20}}</ref>
